ne to see her, threatened by death and ask for help.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>Although &quot;Nandemoya of Flower Street&quot; has nearly 100,000 words of story, it is essentially a strategy game. In terms of combat, it pays special attention to the arrangement and use of skills. Skills are divided into four types. You can get new sSkills and equipments by completing entrusts.Free to create your own fighting style.<br>For players who don't want to think and just want to play sex, the game has also prepared a &quot;simple mode&quot; very intimately. Just press the automatic battle to pass the level easily. The players who are eager to challenge are recommended to carry out the Hard mode to fully experience the fun brought by the combat system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dynamic CG</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rich storyline</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Female characters with different personalities</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Matching Skills</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exciting strategic battles</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Some Japanese dubbing</li></ul><br><br>(Texts in languages other than Chinese and English are temporarily translated mechanically)",
